{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And those remaining among you, and I will bring</b> etc. I will yet exact upon them up to forty-nine blows, corresponding to the forty-nine years of the jubilee cycle during which sabbatical years were abandoned." "<b>Faintness of heart.</b> The first blow. <b>And the sound of a pursued leaf —</b> the second blow." "<b>And they flee as if fleeing from the sword.</b> The third." "<b>And they fall, with none pursuing.</b> The fourth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:40.228196706Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}